From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikael Rousson <85865+mmmikael@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:39:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/16] foyelle: required plugins in every profile, and cron in
 hermes serve

HERMES_REQUIRED_PLUGINS_DIR holds plugins that load in every profile
whatever its config says, in-process, and win over a same-named copy in
a profile. No tool runs in a profile where one of them did not load with
a pre_tool_call hook. HERMES_SERVE_CRON=1 starts the cron ticker in
hermes serve, which otherwise only the Desktop app's backend runs.
---
